    {
      "id": "3c9cadbd4e097c2e43757ba7e10ab805b5f19963b05939c4b60d1492f9e7c67d",
      "text": "Learn how to use Vercel's AI SDK to generate arrays of objects with a Zod schema for creating fake user data.",
